%% Emergency ambulance dispatch and hospital pre-alert.
sequenceDiagram
actor Caller
participant EmergencyLine
participant Dispatcher
participant CAD
participant Ambulance
participant Hospital
Caller->>EmergencyLine: Report emergency
EmergencyLine->>Dispatcher: Incident details
activate Dispatcher
Dispatcher->>CAD: Create incident
CAD-->>Dispatcher: Available units
Dispatcher->>Ambulance: Dispatch
activate Ambulance
par
Dispatcher->>Hospital: Pre-alert
Hospital-->>Dispatcher: Bed status
and
Ambulance->>Ambulance: Assess patient
Ambulance-->>Dispatcher: Condition
end
opt [transport required]
Dispatcher->>Hospital: Confirm destination
Hospital-->>Dispatcher: Accept
end
Ambulance->>Hospital: Handover
deactivate Ambulance
Dispatcher-->>EmergencyLine: Managed
deactivate Dispatcher
Note over Dispatcher,Ambulance: Updates recorded
